00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:28.337
Each window is a pod.

00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:30.748
SlimFaas is the front door for requests.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:36.168
At ten euros per pod-hour, eight idle pods cost eighty euros in one hour.

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:40.571
After the idle timeout, SlimFaas scales the app to zero.

00:00:40.571 --> 00:00:42.811
Another quiet hour adds zero euros.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.467
One request wakes a pod.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:47.153
More requests light up the house.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:49.523
Demand keeps climbing.

00:00:49.523 --> 00:00:51.273
Eight windows become thirty-two.

00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:53.755
